      },
      "purpose": "Whole-database staging copy written by db:import (electron/main.ts .open3dcalc-import-<ts>.tmp in the database directory) so the swap can be validated before the live file is replaced. PII-bearing because the copy is the entire database. It exists only for the duration of the import and is renamed away on success; there is no TTL sweeper, so the SPEC-02 §3 store row 10 purge (tempStagingAdapter) is the only enforcement. GAP: written by a plain fs.copyFile, so this entry declares the REQUIRED encrypted at-rest policy that the code does not yet satisfy.",
      "legal_basis": "consent",
      "owner": "hermes",
      "version": "1.1"
    },
