        "policy": "fixed",
        "max_days": 14
      },
      "purpose": "Operator-requested diagnostic SQLite backups (ADR-003 §2.2), written to an operator-chosen path behind the diagnostic gate. Real retention is 14 days, matching DIAGNOSTIC_RETENTION_DAYS, and a <target>.meta.json sidecar carries it. GAP: the redact:false path (electron/diagnosticBackup.ts) is a straight unredacted, unencrypted fsp.copyFile of the whole database, so this entry declares the REQUIRED at-rest policy that the code does not yet satisfy.",
